  "details": "Before, you could add rich text effects, such as colored text, to interaction prompts. These still apply in world space, but the new tool tips that appear on the side with the new desktop HUD do not respect rich text. This ends up looking really messy and buggy.\n\nIn the picture I provided, I added rich text to my interaction text to turn it red and make it bold. The world is primarily white and the default white text would be hard to read otherwise. However, the tooltip to the right doesn’t have these effects applied.",
